# Caddy serves the JoeMoney bridge over public HTTPS.
# Prerequisites:
#   1. A DNS A record for the hostname below pointing at 178.238.234.68.
#   2. Firewall: allow 443 (and RDP from your admin IP only). Port 8765 must stay loopback.
# Caddy obtains and renews the Let's Encrypt certificate automatically.
bridge.your-domain.com {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8765
}
